# Input

```vue
<template>
  <long-custom-element>word</long-custom-element>
  <span>one two three four five six seven eight nine</span>
  <a-long-long-long-element>foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar</a-long-long-long-element>
  <div>one two three four five six seven eight nine ten</div>
</template>

<template><long-custom-element
>word</long-custom-element
><span
>one two three four five six seven eight nine</span
><a-long-long-long-element
>foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar</a-long-long-long-element
><div
>one two three four five six seven eight nine ten</div
></template>

```


